WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:04.640
What happens when an annoying&nbsp;
T-shirt is put into SCP-914?

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:09.560
A gray T-shirt featuring the phrase "Sorry&nbsp;
I missed the party. I wanted to go but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:14.840
it's Opposite Day." in dark-gray Comic Sans&nbsp;
font was placed into the clockworks on 1:1.

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:18.740
The result was a dark-gray T-shirt&nbsp;
embroidered with "I didn't want to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:23.000
go but it's Opposite Day so here&nbsp;
I am!" in gray Comic Sans font.

